 economy of Pakistan</jats:p>	journal-article	0	10.21010/ajtcam.v12i6.7s	African Traditional Herbal Medicine Supporters Initiative (ATHMSI)	No license URL	No publisher location	0	2505-0044	91	84	0189-6016		https://doi.org/10.21010/ajtcam.v12i6.7s	\N
