ords).</jats:p>	journal-article	0	10.62438/tunismed.v102i9.5110	Tunisian Society of Medical Sciences	https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0	No publisher location	0	2724-7031	\N	\N	0041-4131		https://doi.org/10.62438/tunismed.v102i9.5110	\N
