ic a palpebral tumor. Histopathological examination remains important for treatment and monitoring.</jats:p>	journal-article	0	10.36349/easms.2022.v05i08.001	SASPR Edu International Pvt. Ltd	No license URL	No publisher location	0	2617-4421	232	229	2617-7188		https://doi.org/10.36349/easms.2022.v05i08.001	\N
