eight while 30% used clinical indication as patient parameters. 30% of the reviewed articles did indicate that the surveys to establish NDRLs employed a retrospective approach, while 35% employed a prospective approach and 35% did ..</jats:p>	journal-article	0	10.36349/easjrit.2023.v05i06.001	SASPR Edu International Pvt. Ltd	No license URL	No publisher location	0	2663-1008	113	107	2663-7340		https://doi.org/10.36349/easjrit.2023.v05i06.001	\N
